OL,3,GNEWSADemolition 'gap' to be filled with
OL,4,Aflats and shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gap left by the demolition of two
OL,7,Fformer Grade II-listed buildings will
OL,8,Fbe filled with one-bedroom flats and a
OL,9,Fcommercial premises, a council has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FFenland District Council approved plans
OL,13,Ffor the council-owned site in High
OL,14,FStreet, Wisbech, in Cambridgeshire, on
OL,15,Fthe spaces left when the buildings were
OL,16,Fdemolished in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
