OL,3,GNEWSADemolition 'gap' to be filled with
OL,4,Aflats and shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service, councillors asked
OL,8,Ffor answers at a meeting on 23
OL,9,FSeptember after discovering an earlier
OL,10,Fapplication had been rejected over a
OL,11,Fbat survey issue, which had not been
OL,12,Fshared with all cabinet members.
OL,14,FLeader of the council, Conservative
OL,15,FChris Boden, said: "We must have an
OL,16,Fexplanation about how this has ended up
OL,17,Fhappening."
